  "contact-modal": "<div id=\"leadModal\" class=\"lead-modal-overlay\">\n  <div class=\"lead-modal-container\">\n    <button id=\"closeModalBtn\" class=\"lead-modal-close\" aria-label=\"Close modal\">&times;</button>\n    <div class=\"lead-modal-content-wrapper\" id=\"modalContentWrapper\">\n      <div class=\"lead-modal-header\">\n        <h3 class=\"lead-modal-title\">Get Started</h3>\n        <p class=\"lead-modal-subtitle\">Let's discuss how UppStrive can accelerate your business growth.</p>\n      </div>\n      <form class=\"lead-modal-form\" id=\"leadForm\">\n        <div class=\"lead-modal-form-group\">\n          <label class=\"lead-modal-label\" for=\"leadName\">Full Name</label>\n          <input class=\"lead-modal-input\" type=\"text\" id=\"leadName\" required placeholder=\"John Doe\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lead-modal-form-group\">\n          <label class=\"lead-modal-label\" for=\"leadEmail\">Email Address</label>\n          <input class=\"lead-modal-input\" type=\"email\" id=\"leadEmail\" required placeholder=\"john@company.com\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lead-modal-form-group\">\n          <label class=\"lead-modal-label\" for=\"leadPhone\">Phone Number</label>\n          <input class=\"lead-modal-input\" type=\"tel\" id=\"leadPhone\" placeholder=\"+1 (555) 000-0000\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lead-modal-form-group\">\n          <label class=\"lead-modal-label\" for=\"leadService\">Service Needed</label>\n          <select class=\"lead-modal-select\" id=\"leadService\" required>\n            <option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select a service</option>\n            <option value=\"marketing\">Digital Marketing &amp; Branding</option>\n            <option value=\"it\">Innovative IT &amp; Custom Software</option>\n            <option value=\"both\">Both Marketing &amp; IT Solutions</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lead-modal-form-group\">\n          <label class=\"lead-modal-label\" for=\"leadMessage\">Message</label>\n          <textarea class=\"lead-modal-textarea\" id=\"leadMessage\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your project/goals...\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"lead-modal-submit-btn\" type=\"submit\">Submit Request</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "privacy": "<div class=\"privacy-container\">\n  <h1 class=\"privacy-title\">UppStrive Privacy Policy</h1>\n  <p class=\"privacy-subtitle\">Last updated: July 2026</p>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">1. Introduction</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      At UppStrive (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\"), we are committed to protecting your privacy and safeguarding your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your information when you visit our website, utilize our digital marketing and IT services, or interact with us.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">2. Information We Collect</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      We collect information that you voluntarily provide to us when expressing an interest in obtaining information about us or our products and services, submitting inquiries through lead forms, or communicating with us directly.\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"privacy-list\">\n      <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, company name, and project details provided in contact forms.</li>\n      <li><strong>Usage &amp; Device Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, pages viewed, referring URLs, and access times collected via web analytics.</li>\n      <li><strong>Cookies &amp; Tracking:</strong> Data collected through cookies, web beacons, and performance pixel tools to improve your browsing experience.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      We use the information we collect for legitimate business purposes, including:\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"privacy-list\">\n      <li>Delivering custom digital marketing, branding, AI solutions, and software development services.</li>\n      <li>Responding to inquiries, lead forms, and customer support requests.</li>\n      <li>Improving website performance, analytics, and user experience.</li>\n      <li>Sending relevant service updates, project proposals, and marketing communications.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">4. Information Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We may share information with trusted third-party service providers (such as web hosting, CRM tools, and analytics platforms) solely to perform services on our behalf, under strict confidentiality agreements.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">5. Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      We maintain technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, loss, alteration, or disclosure. We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy or comply with legal obligations.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">6. Your Rights &amp; Data Choices</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      You have the right to access, update, or request the deletion of your personal data at any time. To request account deletion or data removal, please visit your account profile or contact our team directly.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"privacy-section\">\n    <h2 class=\"privacy-section-title\">7. Contact Us</h2>\n    <p class=\"privacy-text\">\n      If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@uppstrive.com\" class=\"privacy-link\">info@uppstrive.com</a>.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
